Package: vyt
Version: 2.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: E-Vex <contact@e-vex.dev>
Depends: yt-dlp, mpv
Description: tiny C wrapper around yt-dlp and mpv
 vyt is a tiny C wrapper around yt-dlp and mpv that makes searching,
 playing and organising YouTube media fast & simple from the terminal.
